title: "RECURSION: an artificial-life research platform"
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it."
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/REPLACE_OWNER/REPLACE_REPO"
abstract: >-
  A local artificial-life observatory. A deterministic mechanics engine advances
  each universe; language models propose actions but never write world state.
  Experiments are paired control/treatment runs, and hypotheses carry a
  provenance classification so prompt-exposed claims are not reported as
  discoveries.
